### Works with the VS Code "REST Client" extension. Start the server first.
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Create
POST {{base}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{"student_id":"STU-2001","full_name":"Nisha Example","date_of_birth":"2004-03-12","email":"nisha.example@example.com","phone":"+91 90000 11111","course":"Physics","address":"Dummy Address","enrollment_date":"2024-08-01"}

### List with search, filter, sort, pagination
GET {{base}}/students?search=nisha&course=Physics&sort_by=full_name&order=asc&page=1&page_size=10

### Get one
GET {{base}}/students/STU-2001

### Replace (PUT needs all required fields)
PUT {{base}}/students/STU-2001
Content-Type: application/json

{"student_id":"STU-2001","full_name":"Nisha Updated","date_of_birth":"2004-03-12","email":"nisha.example@example.com","course":"Chemistry"}

### Partial update
PATCH {{base}}/students/STU-2001
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone":"+91 90000 22222"}

### Delete
DELETE {{base}}/students/STU-2001

### Missing record -> 404
GET {{base}}/students/DOES-NOT-EXIST

### Invalid data -> 422
POST {{base}}/students
Content-Type: application/json

{"student_id":"X","full_name":"","date_of_birth":"2999-01-01","email":"bad"}

### Dashboard stats
GET {{base}}/api/stats

### AI assistant (works even if Ollama is off)
POST {{base}}/api/ai/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{"question":"How many students are enrolled in each course?"}
